From f51e395ca62c725efbf1c739530e3cfd3049714c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:22:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show city residents in the Player menu

Share the chart grid, cursor and icon VRAM with a read-only City tab. Load its roster from the optional DIGI.DAT header extension and build missing-icon grayscale CLUTs on entry. Recompute prosperity independently of tournament cleanup, and retain the original prosperity range when extended story is disabled.
